# Send only files consumed by the backend image contracts.  The build context
# can be handled by a remote BuildKit instance, so local secrets, corpora,
# uploads, test artifacts and caches must fail closed by default.
**

!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!requirements-runtime.lock.txt
!requirements-torch-cpu.lock.txt

!app/
!app/**
!config/
!config/**
!prompts/
!prompts/**
!docker/
!docker/**
!scripts/
!scripts/validate_model_bundle_manifest.py
